 "missing_is_never_zero": "a cell whose server failed, whose driver raised, or whose usability scorer timed out is EXCLUDED and counted above. It is never scored 0 or -1. A CONTENT failure is different: the server answered and the answers were unusable, which is a real -1 and is the cost this experiment exists to count.",
